+ *
+ * This is not optional politeness: I2C2's pins are the ESP32's *only* I2C bus,
+ * shared with the GT911 touch controller, the TCA9554 display expander and the
+ * SW6106 PMIC. A slave that holds SCL low takes all three with it, and the
+ * ESP32 shows it as a white screen with no UI at all -- bsp_display_start()
+ * fails on the GT911 probe before the first LVGL screen is ever loaded.
+ * Nothing on the ESP32 side can clear that; only this can.
+ */
+void tb_slave_service(void);
